## 8. Routing

All routes in `src/constants/routes.ts`:

```typescript
export const ROUTES = {
    HOME: "/",
    POSITIONS: "/projects",
    POSITION_DETAIL: "/projects/:id",
    CANDIDATES: "/projects/:id/employees",
} as const;
```

Navigation — always React Router, never `window.location`:

```typescript
import { useNavigate, useParams } from "react-router-dom";

const navigate = useNavigate();
navigate(ROUTES.POSITIONS);       // go to route
navigate(-1);                      // go back
```

