## 10. Testing Standards

### Unit tests — co-located with component

```
EmployeeCard.tsx
EmployeeCard.test.tsx
```

### Playwright E2E — organized by feature

```
src/frontend/e2e/
├── employees.spec.ts
├── projects.spec.ts
└── auth.spec.ts
```

### Test naming

```typescript
describe("EmployeeCard", () => {
    it("renders employee name and current status badge", () => { ... });
    it("calls onClick with the correct employee when clicked", () => { ... });
    it("shows loading spinner while data is fetching", () => { ... });
    it("displays error alert when API call fails", () => { ... });
});
```

### Playwright — use semantic selectors (never CSS classes)

```typescript
// Good
await page.getByRole("button", { name: /new project/i }).click();
await page.getByLabel(/title/i).fill("Senior Engineer");
await expect(page.getByText("Senior Engineer")).toBeVisible();

// Never
await page.locator(".btn-primary").click();
await page.locator("#title-input").fill("Senior Engineer");
```

### Use `data-testid` only when no semantic selector is available.

