## 11. Performance

- `React.lazy` + `Suspense` for route-level code splitting
- `useCallback` for functions passed as props to memoized children
- `useMemo` for expensive derived values (not for every calculation)
- `React.memo` for components that receive the same props frequently
- Stabilize `useEffect` dependencies — never pass inline objects/arrays

