## Anti-Patterns

These patterns are **never acceptable**. The AI MUST reject, refactor, or flag them when encountered.

| Pattern | Why | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| Direct state mutation in Zustand/React | React won't detect change; stale UI | `set(state => ({ ...state, field: value }))` |
| `useEffect` for data fetching without cleanup | Memory leaks; stale closures | React Query / SWR, or cleanup function |
| Prop drilling more than 2 levels | Tight coupling; refactor magnifier | Zustand store or Context |
| Business logic in components | Untestable; violates SRP | Custom hook or service layer |
| `console.log` left in production | Leaked in bundle; no log levels | Remove or use structured logging |
| Inline styles in JSX | Hard to maintain; no theming | CSS modules or Tailwind classes |
| Missing `key` prop in mapped lists | React reconciliation bugs, performance issues | Unique stable `key` (not array index) |
